{"5109830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Brush Rush", "steam_appid": 5109830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5150400], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint your own path! Parkour to escape from hunters in this colorful funny <strong>tag</strong> game! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5109830/extras/6fb7398551bbde12f43316e8a63e833e.poster.avif?t=1788184754\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5109830/extras/6fb7398551bbde12f43316e8a63e833e.webm?t=1788184754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5109830/extras/6fb7398551bbde12f43316e8a63e833e.mp4?t=1788184754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brush Rush!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its the meccha (super) fun game of tag we all grew playing... except with magical paint brushes, paint shotguns, a pair of boxing gloves, and insane parkour skills!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Put on some special boxing gloves!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the Hunter, you’ll be equipped with special boxing gloves that do more than just pack a punch. Use them to lunge and leap farther in any direction, giving you the mobility you need to catch those pesky Painters!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Paint your path!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Runner, you can paint 3D platforms out of thin air to create your own escape routes. Climb onto rooftops, slide down slopes, bridge large gaps, or block the Hunter’s path. Paint wherever you need to go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5109830/extras/fea7589e1dc2a36c777304ce322553a7.poster.avif?t=1788184754\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5109830/extras/fea7589e1dc2a36c777304ce322553a7.webm?t=1788184754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5109830/extras/fea7589e1dc2a36c777304ce322553a7.mp4?t=1788184754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Test your aim with the paint shotgun!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are unable to catch the runners with boxing gloves alone, don't worry, you can shoot them down with your trusty paint shotgun. Or atleast destroy their paint paths so they are easier to catch!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Proximity Voice Chat!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice chat adds a ton of humor to the game. Some of the funniest moments happen when you hear the painters running and screaming as you chase them!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more the merrier! Play with friends, foes, or even randos in this funny and exciting multiplayer tag game. 2-12 players is our recommended party size!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5109830/extras/3682f9e91969a9c9457ad3f74c426746.poster.avif?t=1788184754\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5109830/extras/3682f9e91969a9c9457ad3f74c426746.webm?t=1788184754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5109830/extras/3682f9e91969a9c9457ad3f74c426746.mp4?t=1788184754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Videos and Streaming</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We strongly encourage to post videos and go live on stream. We only ask 2 things</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Include the name of the game in the title</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Include a link to the steam store page in the description</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you have a blast!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint your own path! Parkour to escape from hunters in this colorful funny <strong>tag</strong> game! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5109830/extras/6fb7398551bbde12f43316e8a63e833e.poster.avif?t=1788184754\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5109830/extras/6fb7398551bbde12f43316e8a63e833e.webm?t=1788184754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5109830/extras/6fb7398551bbde12f43316e8a63e833e.mp4?t=1788184754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brush Rush!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its the meccha (super) fun game of tag we all grew playing... except with magical paint brushes, paint shotguns, a pair of boxing gloves, and insane parkour skills!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Put on some special boxing gloves!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the Hunter, you’ll be equipped with special boxing gloves that do more than just pack a punch. Use them to lunge and leap farther in any direction, giving you the mobility you need to catch those pesky Painters!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Paint your path!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Runner, you can paint 3D platforms out of thin air to create your own escape routes. Climb onto rooftops, slide down slopes, bridge large gaps, or block the Hunter’s path. Paint wherever you need to go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5109830/extras/fea7589e1dc2a36c777304ce322553a7.poster.avif?t=1788184754\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5109830/extras/fea7589e1dc2a36c777304ce322553a7.webm?t=1788184754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5109830/extras/fea7589e1dc2a36c777304ce322553a7.mp4?t=1788184754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Test your aim with the paint shotgun!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are unable to catch the runners with boxing gloves alone, don't worry, you can shoot them down with your trusty paint shotgun. Or atleast destroy their paint paths so they are easier to catch!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Proximity Voice Chat!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice chat adds a ton of humor to the game. Some of the funniest moments happen when you hear the painters running and screaming as you chase them!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more the merrier! Play with friends, foes, or even randos in this funny and exciting multiplayer tag game. 2-12 players is our recommended party size!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5109830/extras/3682f9e91969a9c9457ad3f74c426746.poster.avif?t=1788184754\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steam